":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T02:26:42-07:00","id":472448,"title":"","content":"If I recall pacts are nullified if the pact is destroyed but no mention of the demons destruction is mentioned in the pact section. Bear in mind that you can loot other demons stash of pacts (mentions of finding pacts of dead demons in fluff I belive) or willingly trade pacts.<br /> <br /> So I would say pacts like gadgets exist unless destroyed even after a demon's demise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T05:10:02-07:00","id":472533,"title":"","content":"IIRC form gadgets <i>might</i> survive, but for some reason seem to break when their creator dies, possibly due to being linked to them in some way, since they also get destroyed when it goes loud. <br /> <br /> Of course it could just be that unless ambushed a dying demon probably <i>will</i> go loud as a last resort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T10:51:08-07:00","id":473046,"title":"","content":"Where is it mentioned that gadgets get destroyed when a demon goes loud? If I missed that we'll that is a great over sight on my part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachmen